(text "AO SUPPLY VAO 16.1 V  -  DC-DC (decision #37)" (at 21.59 23.368 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3b1f0b00-dbc7-5687-ba4f-4c790ab0cdfe))
(text "VAO = 0.8 V x (1 + 422k/22.1k) = 16.08 V (15.5-16.6 V). LMR51606 FPWM 1.1 MHz, max duty 98 %." (at 21.59 69.596 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3cd4b5aa-0c4a-5730-97a2-950e4cb32492))
(text "Load 2 x (DAC 27 + OPA197 1.3 + TPS26611 1.75 mA) = 60 mA. C46/C56 at U9/U10 pin 6." (at 21.59 73.152 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5f305a74-33d2-5520-82a3-c4285d32b853))
(text "VIN_P < ~17 V: VAO follows VIN_P (dropout). 24 mA x 500 ohm OK down to VIN ~15.8 V." (at 21.59 76.708 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 54e05ca7-2307-51bb-92e5-35117a937008))
