(text "  from about 0.66 W to 0.39 W per channel (24 mA short, any supply 12-28 V)." (at 21.59 102.108 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ddcf8f22-471b-5ebd-9a67-9453bb2f86c2))
(text "  Thermal test on a potted prototype still planned." (at 21.59 107.696 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 466cbb6d-f869-58f5-9e6e-e9acebb71357))
(text "HSE crystal: no room next to PF0/PF1 -> factory HSI trim + firmware HSI calibration" (at 21.59 113.284 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7ada4d5a-5e62-5254-bcc6-49928233249c))
(text "  from Modbus frame timing (USART auto-baud / timer capture)." (at 21.59 118.872 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5b3ae09b-087a-582c-958a-731904430c35))
(text "Sensor-line ESD array: no room next to J3 -> probe ESD test (IEC 61000-4-2) decides;" (at 21.59 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b9f647c5-ceeb-5546-b472-66f4d8059c5f))
(text "  if needed: protect at the HTX99R side or in the next PCB rev." (at 21.59 130.048 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d58ac0a5-669d-5752-9d2c-4fb94cdff943))
